adjudication.rationale:
In EventManager.ts, the diff changes destinationCalendar to an array and adds:

```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar") {
  evt["location"] = "integrations:daily";
}
```

If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `null`, `undefined`, or an empty array, `mainHostDestinationCalendar` becomes `undefined`. When `evt.location === MeetLocationType` is true, the right side of `&&` is evaluated and `mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration` throws a TypeError. This breaks the intended fallback path for Google Meet without a Google Calendar destination.
